@startuml
' AuctionSession state diagram - matches AuctionStatus enum
state "AuctionSession" as AuctionState {
  [*] --> OPEN : create session
  OPEN --> RUNNING : first valid bid / active time
  OPEN --> FINISHED : endTime reached without cancel
  RUNNING --> RUNNING : valid bid updates price
  RUNNING --> RUNNING : anti-snipe extends endTime
  RUNNING --> FINISHED : endTime reached
  OPEN --> CANCELED : cancel/delete
  RUNNING --> CANCELED : cancel/delete
  FINISHED --> PAID : settlement successful
  FINISHED --> CANCELED : no winner / invalid settlement
  PAID --> [*]
  CANCELED --> [*]
}

note right of AuctionState
Statuses are defined in AuctionStatus:
OPEN, RUNNING, FINISHED, PAID, CANCELED.
end note
@enduml